================================================================================
THIRD-PARTY FILES  —  not covered by the licences above
================================================================================

The file NOTICE lists them with their origin and what was derived from them:

  - phase3/full_runs/real_data/source/: the archive of the public repository of
    the dataset studied (arXiv:2606.15983) at one commit, text copies of its
    code files and its licence text, under the Apache License 2.0
    (phase3/full_runs/real_data/source/LICENSE_upstream.txt). The files of
    phase3/full_runs/real_data/converted/ are a format conversion of its data
    files and are distributed under the same Apache License 2.0, with the
    changes stated in NOTICE.
  - phase3/full_runs/huang/data_huang/ and phase3/full_runs/learning/data_huang20/:
    data files of Huang et al., Science 377, eabk3333 (2022), under the MIT
    License of their repository (LICENSE_upstream.md in each folder).
  - calibration_snapshot.json under phase3/full_runs/qpu/jobs/ and
    phase3/full_runs/final_tests/jobs/: calibration data of the processor as
    returned by IBM Quantum services, kept as the record of the author's runs.
